      "url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcfQbPBBwac/",
      "cached": {
        "caption": "A 2nd brow session for this sweet girl! 🥹🩷 \n\nShe came in 6 weeks ago wanting to have more of a define and lifted brow. We played it safe for the first session because this is where we’re creating the foundation. \n\nI call the first session “data gathering”. Nerdy of me, I know. 🤓 BUT it gives us the opportunity to understand how the skin takes the pigment. And honestly, I was pleasantly surprised. Her brows healed well despite her having a little more of oily skin. \n\n💁🏽‍♀️ Reality check reminder: once your brows are fresh out of a session, they are more intense than usual. After the fact, they will go in phases so expect that your instant result may look much different in the upcoming weeks of healing. \n\nShe came back in for her 2nd session. We were able to  define and refresh her brows even more to keep the retention longer. Depending on her lifestyle, aftercare, and truly her genetics, we’ll gladly see her back around 1-2 years. ✨ \n\n#pmu #vegas #brows #ombrepowderbrows #filipina",
